OL,3,GNEWSAGhost dog story lives on after
OL,4,Aalmost 150 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe stuffed dog on display at Lincoln
OL,7,FCastle is an arresting sight for
OL,8,Fvisitors, but the story behind it is
OL,9,Fstranger than even they can imagine.
OL,11,FIt is of an unnamed lurcher who died
OL,12,Falmost 150 years ago, yet regulars at
OL,13,Fthe nearby Strugglers Inn still claim
OL,14,Fto feel his presence.
OL,16,FThe pub stands yards away from the
OL,17,Fwalls of the castle, which is hosting
OL,18,F"spooky stories or eerie tales" this
OL,19,FHalloween in its former Victorian
OL,20,Fprison.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
