OL,3,GNEWSAGhost dog story lives on after
OL,4,Aalmost 150 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is also where the dog's owner,
OL,7,FWilliam Clarke was executed in 1877
OL,8,Fafter being convicted of murdering a
OL,9,Fgamekeeper who interrupted his
OL,10,Fpoaching.
